[{"type":"message","user":"U027BQYM708","text":"\u003c@U027BQYM708\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1625050398.290200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"42b087c6-d952-40fc-9028-219fd1765a5f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうですね。ちょっと試すときは名前なしで書きます。","ts":"1625044350.290000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D9u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d312e222-e511-4db4-9b95-6914c533ceda","type":"message","user":"U01TQP86UM6","text":"graphqlのクエリに名前なんてあったっけと調べてみたら必ずしも必須というわけではないものなんですね\n\u003chttps://graphql.org/learn/queries/#operation-name\u003e\n\u0026gt; マルチオペレーションのドキュメントでのみ必要とされますが、デバッグやサーバサイドのロギングに非常に役立つため、その使用が推奨されます。","ts":"1625044325.289600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hex8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ca1c04f-7502-47c5-b083-bad11c032f6e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ところで…フラグメントって引数として渡せなかったっけかと、今調べてるところ。","ts":"1625043891.289100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Klilq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f0ca978-b771-4068-96b8-426f1ba026c1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみになんですがクエリ内に付けた名前はフラグメント名とか、サーバーの実装にはまったく関係なくて、全部GraphQLのサーバーライブラリがやってくれます。","ts":"1625043818.288600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bOGAk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"797c6a68-79a2-4732-a8b5-1276e42bacca","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分自分が理解できてなくてどこかが噛み合ってない気がする・・・\n申し訳ないです","ts":"1625043678.287500","thread_ts":"1625043678.287500","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dgNA6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c637320-4de6-497d-ba32-a2c087aecd12","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"スキーマに変更がない限りは","ts":"1625043654.286800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P8J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6cb1563-47cc-42ef-9bbe-a5255ce14142","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ならないですよ","ts":"1625043639.286300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QeZh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59287f8e-8c4a-4811-a754-1d868e5a406d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"です、名前を付けていけばいいんですが、フロントが投げるクエリの都合でサーバサイドで名前を付けて実装していかないといけないってことになりません？\nフロントの話かな","ts":"1625043618.286100","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1625043642.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wvNC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d9285d1-4a0e-4c6b-b2d8-55cd676e27f9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"適切な(≒ユニークな)名前つければ済む話じゃないの?","ts":"1625043552.285300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"luE0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"483f4ed7-b724-4428-9a6f-b4c1390e1d0e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ちょっと後で確かめます\nまた用事が・・・","ts":"1625043468.284800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DRoG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f62dcc4-e589-4cb9-9bf4-8a695661d442","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、それでも落ちたはず・・・","ts":"1625043461.284500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sAN9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffb4296f-bcbe-4f95-88b0-52357f53e5d1","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"```query NamedUser($id: Int!) {\n  getUser(id: $id) {\n    name\n  }\n}\nquery AgedUser($id: Int!) {\n  getUser(id: $id) {\n    age\n  }\n}```\nならば問題ないはずです","ts":"1625043428.284300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4s3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3def4854-ab15-4f00-a134-5ac50826dab8","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"```query User($id: Int!) {\n  getUser(id: $id) {\n    name\n  }\n}\nquery User($id: Int!) {\n  getUser(id: $id) {\n    age\n  }\n}```\nこらは operation name `User` が同じだから code gen できない","ts":"1625043400.283700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w6RhA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41bbf448-e56c-4321-918b-8d5a04d2204b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```query User($id: Int!) {\n  getUser(id: $id) {\n    name\n  }\n}\nquery User($id: Int!) {\n  getUser(id: $id) {\n    age\n  }\n}```\nは落ちるので、片方のプロパティが取りたいだけの場合でもcodegenの都合で\n```query User($id: Int!) {\n  getUser(id: $id) {\n    name\n    age\n  }\n}```\nと書くしかない","ts":"1625043399.283600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/N3c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24d31708-9e83-463e-b1f5-9fd0a0815364","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"ちがいますね？","ts":"1625043357.281900","edited":{"user":"UNM8AVCB0","ts":"1625043368.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"question","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Cq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8118f148-e140-4e8c-b28e-a4fcf9b3b365","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"getUserでnameだけ取るクエリと、getUserでageだけ取るクエリをフロントから投げたいとして、codegenするとgetUserがduplicateしてるって怒られるんですよね\nなのでフロントが余計なプロパティを取得しないような実装がもしやりたいとすると、getUserWithNameとgetUserWithAgeをResolverに実装しないと実現できないって意図でした","ts":"1625043304.281300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KP/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e760f169-4033-4825-9ddc-a0e220dc8844","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"# ちなみにサーバー側でresolverが増えるのはスキーマに引数付きフィールドが増えたときで、とある実装ではリソースの種類が同じなら1つのresolverを使いまわせたりします。","ts":"1625043239.280300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rDl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9dc6958-205c-40c2-a990-20290af3b440","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; クエリのパターンを分けるとその1つ1つResolverを増やしていかないといけなくないですか？\nえ、だとしたらこの質問がなぜでてきたのかが、まったくわからないw","ts":"1625043130.277800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zEyi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f72a61f9-10de-4c8a-a9ad-af911d164fc2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、それは分かります","ts":"1625043098.277200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"igZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f4659af-4b91-44bf-a8df-6ebd09c473a5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"サーバー側のresolverはフラグメントを考慮することもできるし、しないこともできるんです。ぶっちゃけnameしか必要とされてなくても、User全体をDBから引いて返して良い。あとはGraphQLライブラリが必要なものだけ返してくれる。","ts":"1625043083.277000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E55co"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbc0477b-47bc-4e30-b3a6-c401c008a87b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"意思疎通ができてない感じですみません","ts":"1625043038.276200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rbha"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e88d24bf-2257-4f2a-8a64-7fca7b6fa4c0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分がクエリって単語を使ってるのがめっちゃよくない気がする","ts":"1625043020.275500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E6V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ea55c58-75b3-46d0-b80b-3b33577cf783","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それはサーバーの話ですよね?","ts":"1625042992.274700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w/1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8737b3bb-16c5-4a43-9beb-78db9d9430e7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分意味は分かってるんですけど、クエリのパターンを分けるとその1つ1つResolverを増やしていかないといけなくないですか？","ts":"1625042969.274200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/XqVR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c82a94b0-91e3-4f80-8bbe-6b8e18267f5e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"クエリの再利用はして良いんですが、生成されたコードの再利用は考えない。という意味ね。","ts":"1625042904.272600","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1625042912.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ni0m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ff6081d-19a4-4032-8145-88e003da7d7d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"クライアント側のGraphQLコード生成では下手に再利用しようと思わないほうが良いと思いますよ。","ts":"1625042866.271800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1625042874.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TUOB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72c6522f-606a-44cb-8acf-a3559b3efc53","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どっちかっていうとフロントで一番大きいクエリを投げるようにしか実装することができないのがおかしいというか","ts":"1625042821.271200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pjo0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95167806-9cdb-4525-b2a2-483d626a8b33","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"はい、そこについては自分が間違えてるなって思いました","ts":"1625042775.270400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l2s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b22a4b7b-46d5-4b07-88cf-929cb3ac515e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"サーバーの実装側はなんら影響を受けないですよ。","ts":"1625042753.269600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cl3s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"728c40da-cce1-46b9-b3ff-e1259eedef13","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"えーっと、（ユースケースとして少ないかもしれないと思ってきてるんですが）getUserを叩くユースケースが複数あったとして、フロントが実行するgetUserのクエリは1つしか定義できないので、例えばnameだけを取りたい状況があったとしても最も大きいFragmentに合わせたクエリを投げないといけなくなっちゃいますよね","ts":"1625042683.268500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3pJ+R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13695b20-4e86-4bad-ae18-10ae1c54211e","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"```query User($id: Int!) {\n  getUser(id: $id) {\n    age\n  }\n}```\nRPC だと\n```// client\n\nfunction User(id) {\n  const result = server.getUser(id)\n  return { age: result.age }\n}```\nみたいですね\nサーバ側は `User` の部分を気にしなくてもいいです","ts":"1625042523.265200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"65le"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22eaed6a-3a34-4d0a-a3c6-62fc2fd8aa6e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"GraphQLではまずスキーマがあって、サーバ側ではそのスキーマに従ってresolverを作るし、クライアント側ではそのスキーマに従ってクエリを書くってのが僕の認識で、クエリが先ではないのですよ。","ts":"1625042516.265000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1625042595.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AK/Ip"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6d03fa2-c647-4916-a409-371f3f750f1b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いいかえると\n\n\u0026gt; サーバにクエリを発行する側の都合でサーバがResolverを実装していかないといけない\nこの発想がどこからきてるかが理解できてない。","ts":"1625042443.262700","thread_ts":"1625042333.260400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1625042620.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gPcTx"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"0e220167-4048-4df0-91d4-b0eaa84cca8a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーんって思ってるのは、今書いたとおりサーバにクエリを発行する側の都合でサーバがResolverを実装していかないといけないのってどうなのかってところです","ts":"1625042333.260400","thread_ts":"1625042333.260400","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1625042353.000000"},"reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CjS"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"02a90092-6b45-4a9d-89d5-578cfb02e5ea","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たとえばこういうスキーマがあったとき、サーバーは `user` に対して resolver を1つ書けば、あとはGraphQLライブラリがいいようにしてくれる。","ts":"1625042372.261200","files":[{"id"